WEBVTT

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:17.760
Mr. Daijuji? Mr. Daijuji?

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:19.000
Are you okay?

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.260
Mr. Daijuji?

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:24.460
Al... Al...

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:27.960
Al...

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:34.820
Al!

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:53.630
Excellent work, everyone.

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:56.250
I didn't expect it to be that easy.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:59.520
The Grand Master was surprisingly feeble.

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:03.870
And I got to play with Kuro plenty.
I suppose I'm satisfied.

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:07.270
I got him back for my arm.

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:09.840
All that's left is to destroy, annihilate,

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:13.010
and devour the Hado Foundation's base.

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:16.800
And no one — no one — will
remain to stand against us.

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:18.550
Then let us destroy them.

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:20.750
They'll make an excellent example.

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:23.460
Let us launch a third attack

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:25.620
before they can organize their defenses.

00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:32.610
Let me go!

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:35.010
Don't move, Kuro!

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:37.970
We need to get you to a doctor
fast, or you'll die!

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:38.900
Shut up!

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:41.670
Please calm down, Mr. Daijuji.

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:44.240
The medical team is on its way.

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:45.180
Move!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:46.840
I have to go!

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:50.850
I'm going to kick the crap
out of the Black Lodge!

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:54.150
That's insanity.

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:58.090
You have no hope of beating them now!

00:02:58.090 --> 00:02:59.790
That's right!

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:03.030
With Al gone, you can't control Demonbane.

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:04.460
And you can't even become a Magius.

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:09.670
Al died protecting me!

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:12.530
I can't believe it...

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:15.790
I'll never forgive them!

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:17.600
I can't!

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:21.400
I have to destroy them!

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.420
Mr. Daijuji!

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:26.980
Al saved my life! I have to use it to fight...

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:30.750
If you think she saved your life, then just stop.

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:35.790
You can't waste the life she saved.

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:40.230
Mr. Daijuji, enduring is a part of battle, too.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.430
Mistress... No, Commander.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:46.640
A single Destroyer Robot has
launched from the base above.

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:49.510
It's heading for the Hado estate.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:58.020
A Destroyer Robot?

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:09.920
Darling!

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:10.600
Elsa!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.360
Please-robo...

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.070
Save the Doctor-robo!

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:25.280
Thank you-robo.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.970
You really are the best-robo!

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:32.750
Is it okay to do this, Mr. Daijuji?

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:36.260
They're part of the Black Lodge.

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:37.720
No-robo!

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:41.920
The Doctor already quit the Black Lodge-robo.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.530
Reporting.

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:49.400
The aerial fortress is silent. No sign of attack.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:50.700
Why?

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:53.100
Now is their chance to attack.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.870
It's thanks to the Doctor-robo.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:58.580
He destroyed the Destroyer
Robot control system-robo.

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:01.540
What's going on?

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:03.880
I'll explain-robo.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:06.730
Master Therion activated Plan C,

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:09.360
in other words, the summoning of Cthulhu

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:13.890
in order to wield his mighty powers-robo.

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:17.830
That's why he was searching for
Al Azif and the R'lyeh Text-robo.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.930
But after he succeeded in summoning Cthulhu,

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:23.830
Anticross betrayed him.

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:27.570
Anticross intends to use Cthulhu

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:29.540
to take over the world-robo!

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:33.390
The Doctor was opposed to this plan-robo!

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:35.350
He said that there was no need to rely on

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.250
a Dark God's power, and that his
own robots would be enough...

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:43.350
In the end, he's still a bad guy, huh?

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:46.730
And so the Doctor said they
violated his sense of aesthetics,

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:48.560
and he left the Black Lodge-robo.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:51.400
While he fled, he was attacked

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:52.700
and wounded-robo.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.350
Can we believe her?

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:59.600
Elsa wouldn't lie to her beloved darling-robo...

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:03.690
Mr. Daijuji, where are you going?

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:14.940
Damn that idiot!

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:19.090
I'll kill them all!

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:25.030
How's it looking?

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:27.920
The Toy Reanimators are functioning normally.

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:30.080
Repairs are proceeding apace.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:31.080
I see.

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.340
Please hurry.

00:06:33.610 --> 00:06:37.340
But no matter how much we repair it,
without Al, Demonbane...

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:38.650
I know.

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:41.310
But we can't do nothing.

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:42.750
And...

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:48.190
That used book girl may just be playing dead...

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:49.020
Commander...

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:51.030
We need Demonbane

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:53.490
completely fixed and in order,
so that we're ready for anything.

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:56.010
Just like my grandfather...

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:57.010
Roger!

00:06:57.010 --> 00:06:58.460
Leave it to me!

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:01.730
I'll have it good as new in no time!

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.770
Seventy percent of our forces
are now equipped

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.070
with magic-enhanced weaponry.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:10.100
Internal base barriers being
maintained at 130% output.

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:12.540
Counterattack system is on
standby at DEFCON 1.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:15.440
Let's do everything we can.

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:19.520
We owe it to the grandfather of
the mistress to do everything we can.

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:21.520
Winfield...

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:25.030
We'll fight to the last.

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:26.290
Right!

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:28.490
<i>Mr. Daijuji...</i>

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:37.780
What's wrong?

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:39.930
Are you lost?

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:40.580
Yeah.

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:42.230
Stone!

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.770
We've got another man down over here!

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.490
Take him to the doctor!

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:48.480
Roger, Detective Nes.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:49.740
Can you stand?

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:58.220
Okay, I'll help you find your mom.

00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:00.430
Where's Demonbane?

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:03.690
Did Demonbane lose?

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:05.580
No.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.510
It will never lose.

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:11.670
It's a hero, you know.

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:17.110
Alison, hand me the bandages.

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:17.970
Okay!

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:23.200
Sister Raika, I got us some soup!

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:27.080
You two can rest now.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:31.370
Are you okay, mister?

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:34.030
Lie down over there.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.410
We'll heal you up.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.190
Thanks, kid!

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:41.110
Sister Raika?

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:42.670
What?

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:46.380
Is Kuro okay?

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.880
Don't worry.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.640
It'll take more than that to get rid of Kuro.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:55.860
He'll beat the bad guys and protect everyone.

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:00.650
<i>Please, Kuro...</i>

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:03.780
<i>Darling...</i>

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.420
<i>Mr. Daijuji...</i>

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.820
<i>At first, I was just a bystander,
caught up in everything.</i>

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:04.140
<i>Dragged into it by that
foul-mouthed used book.</i>

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:07.610
<i>I found myself fighting,
never even wondering why.</i>

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:14.430
<i>It was rage that forged my resolve to fight!</i>

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:22.900
<i>It was because the people,
whom I cared about,</i>

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:26.300
<i>were near me that I was able to fight.</i>

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:30.370
<i>I didn't want to see them suffer.</i>

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:33.370
<i>I didn't want to regret anything.</i>

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:37.090
<i>I'm sure those feelings have kept me going.</i>

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:41.050
<i>I love this town...</i>

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:47.020
<i>This Arkham City, where
the people I love live.</i>

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:48.020
<i>Al...</i>

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:51.460
<i>You're the same as me, right?</i>

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:55.380
Just you wait, Anticross!

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:05.770
What?

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:14.390
Demonbane is back?

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:17.580
Aren't you lonely tonight?

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:21.170
Aren't you lonely tonight without me?

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:24.090
Do you regret saying goodbye?

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.460
Doctor West!

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:27.750
You're late, Kuro Daijuji!

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:28.780
I've been waiting for you.

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:30.260
Darling!

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:32.120
I've been waiting-robo.

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:33.760
What is this?

00:12:33.760 --> 00:12:37.170
I just played with the repair system a bit.

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:40.220
With my brilliant, artistic super-brain,
I could do this not only before breakfast,

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:42.210
but before before-the-breakfast, which I ate,

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:45.510
before the lunch, which I ate, before I ate dinner
the night before I ate breakfast!

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:46.920
What? Did I loop?

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:50.350
Or would that mean that I
spent a whole day on it?

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:52.500
Even I don't know.

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:54.820
I don't know, either!

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:56.690
Anyway...

00:12:56.690 --> 00:13:00.720
Anticross is my hated foe, as well.

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:03.790
Thus, I would like to form an alliance with you!

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:04.980
What?

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:06.780
I should imagine that my brains

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:09.530
and expertise would be of use to you...

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:15.540
As proof, I've taken Demonbane
and repaired it!

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:19.120
Yeah?

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:20.700
But it's no good.

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:24.340
I can't pilot Demonbane.

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:26.780
I heard about Al Azif.

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:30.500
But my genius has compensated for that!

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:33.060
I've modified it along the same theories

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:36.680
as Super West Invincible
Robot 28 Deluxe, AKA Demonpain.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:39.600
You can pilot it without transforming.

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:45.170
The rest is up to you, Kuro Daijuji!

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:48.310
Right!

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:53.310
Anticross is attacking-robo!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.120
Kuro Daijuji!

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:56.780
Let's jam!

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:10.510
Report!

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:12.260
Total number of enemy Destroyer Robots, 100.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:16.030
They're attacking in waves,
directly above the base.

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:19.380
Automatic counterattack
system damage, at 40%.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:22.290
Barrier strength, decreased to 60%!

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:24.300
Prioritize the barriers.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:27.000
And move the evacuees in
the shelter to the central area.

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:29.200
What's wrong?

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:32.150
Imaginary Number Expansion
Catapult is starting up!

00:14:32.150 --> 00:14:33.540
What?

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:34.950
It can't be...

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:37.220
Tachyon counter active.

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:39.880
It's here!

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:42.060
Demonbane is materializing!

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:45.690
Elsa!

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:47.200
Release output on leg shields!

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:48.620
Roger-robo!

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:49.900
Space-time distorting.

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:09.420
Is that you, Mr. Daijuji?

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:11.020
Amazing!

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:14.060
When did you get it so perfectly
repaired, Chiaki?

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:18.620
Now, show them Kuro Daijuji...

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:22.130
The trinity consisting of you,
my brains, and Demonbane!

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:34.830
We did it-robo!

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:36.850
But we're out of bullets-robo.

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:38.250
Just ahead of us, darling!

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:48.330
You and I are a perfect team-robo.

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:51.050
Why is Demonbane...

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.000
Impressive!

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.830
Impressive, <i>Necronomicon</i>!

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:56.070
A truly formidable foe, not
to be underestimated.

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:58.050
He survived?

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:01.650
This time, I'll finish him for good!

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:03.070
That's strange.

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:06.400
I don't feel the <i>Necronomicon</i>.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:10.010
Then I'll just have to keep beating
on him till I feel satisfied!

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.460
So there you are!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.830
Initiate Ether Dancer mode!

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:30.230
Roger-robo!

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:45.440
<i>Atlantis Strike!</i>

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:54.390
Y-You bastard!

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:56.700
I'm sure you know this,

00:16:56.700 --> 00:17:00.240
but right now, I'm functioning
in place of a grimoire-robo.

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:04.230
There's a limit on any attacks
requiring magic-robo.

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:07.940
So basically, all you can do is
keep Demonbane moving?

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:10.010
The only attacks you can use right now are

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:11.240
those not requiring magic...

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:12.680
The leg shields and...

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:14.580
Lemuria Impact?

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:15.840
Perfect!

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:17.810
That's more than enough!

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:29.590
What's wrong?

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:31.230
You're moving slowly!

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:32.540
Damn it!

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:33.350
<i>Timaeus!</i>

00:17:33.350 --> 00:17:34.200
<i>Critias!</i>

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:36.800
What?

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:41.720
Th-That's crazy-robo...

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:44.510
If you're my partner, then deal with it!

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:49.010
Hiranyapura System, access!

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:50.010
Lemuria—

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:51.250
Darling! Get back-robo!

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:58.210
A magical wall?

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:07.960
Mr. Daijuji!

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:09.920
Withdraw to the elevator.

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:11.130
We'll extract you.

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:15.280
I don't think he's gonna let me.

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.770
Pathetic, Kuro Daijuji.

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:19.950
Will you not listen to my orders?

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.950
Since when are you my boss?!

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:24.210
Do the impossible, and everyone will follow.

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.720
I have a wonderful idea!

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:28.350
Listen.

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:31.250
Return to base, just like the plan...

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:33.820
I have no idea what plan this is!

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:40.160
Whatever!

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:48.440
Damn, did he run?

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:51.540
No.

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:55.380
This sound... He's trying to trick me?

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:09.660
This is it!

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:12.460
Die!

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:19.770
That was a sad ending, Kuro Daijuji!

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:25.140
What?

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:28.950
This is one of our Destroyer Robots!

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:34.050
<i>Return to nothingness, never thirsting,
never hungering!</i>

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:36.750
Demonbane!

00:19:38.180 --> 00:19:42.530
<i>Lemuria Impact!</i>

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:46.660
<i>Sublimate!</i>

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:11.150
What?

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:13.690
Caligula!

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:18.300
Azathoth signal dissipation confirmed.

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:21.260
Enemy Deus Machina has been destroyed.

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:22.900
We did it!

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:25.070
Winfield...

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.790
Yes?

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:30.040
The demon-slaying sword is still with us!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.440
Of course.

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:35.350
I spent the entire night working on it...

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:37.940
I'd expect no less a result.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.860
Darling, we really did it-robo!

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:03.230
<i>We're still fighting together.</i>

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:09.670
<i>Right, Al?</i>

00:22:55.050 --> 00:22:57.130
The hunters come,

00:22:57.130 --> 00:22:59.770
wreathed in smoke and blood,
with murderous fangs.

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:02.170
But beware! For your prey is, himself, a hunter.

00:23:02.170 --> 00:23:04.030
And in his hand is a sword.

00:23:04.030 --> 00:23:06.250
Next time: The Hunt.

00:23:06.620 --> 00:23:09.760
My fists are for my oath to slay demons!
